  - m_Id: 3656455089278980
    m_Localized: I don't want to sleep right now. I'm full of energy!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3656498731012100
    m_Localized: I can't sleep now. What if someone comes here looking for shelter?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3656533392740350
    m_Localized: Looks like no one else is coming tonight.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3656689349545980
    m_Localized: Smells like someone died tonight...
