  - m_Id: 63931917744721920
    m_Localized: "1. Today the world was built anew,\nAnd in the basement, mushroom grew.\nIt towered high, and time is nigh\nTo eat it whole, if one would try.\n\n2. To welcome guests is not for strong,\nThe Mushroom stands, tall and long\nUnder Tree of Apple can you rest,\nShe'll feed you with her sweet fruit's best.\n\n\n3. The day will come, when one must kneel\nBefore the mushroom's mighty peal\nWhile on the clock the hand shall climb.\nMake haste, my friend, there is no time!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
