      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80910065015181312
    m_Localized: Looks like I won't be picking up any more radio broadcasts today.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 81558843359481856
    m_Localized: crazy granny
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 83008742139613184
    m_Localized: Instructions
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 83079022971179008
    m_Localized: Better not go in there right now. I'll check during the day.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 83079056223621120
    m_Localized: I'm afraid looking out right now will make me go blind. I'd better take a peek at night.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 83079087727038464
    m_Localized: There's no time for this today.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 83079202038599680
    m_Localized: There's no time for this today.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 83079270019878912
    m_Localized: There's no time for this today.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 83079223148531712
    m_Localized: No one will be out on the street at this time of day.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 83741359755481088
    m_Localized: I think I'm done for today.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 86605930199502848
    m_Localized: Wishlist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85609794512867328
    m_Localized: To catch a signal, turn the right knob. To do this, left-click and hold on the right knob and move your cursor left or right. The knob for adjusting the volume is on the left.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85609992173637632
    m_Localized: I removed the wave blocker from the radios. Fuck them!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85988737455738880
    m_Localized: Fuck... It doesn't work now
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85989059582480384
    m_Localized: If you still can't get a signal, try changing the wave range. To do this, left-click on the handles in the middle and continue searching for the wave you need with the right knob.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 86608835057012736
    m_Localized: "You can see more and more Visitors on the street. The sun is heating the Earth more and more. Death is on our doorstep.\n\nNobody wants to die. But you need to survive, you want to live more than others. Or is it not a desire to live but a fear of the unknown? What is there, after death?\n\nWe don’t know. But maybe the Visitors know something?.. Maybe we’ll be able to survive this summer, so that this fall we can try to discover the answers to the most terrible question.\n\nWe just have to wait a little. Survive the summer heat. Don’t let the Visitors in.\n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88075057707601920
    m_Localized: No
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88075038585769984
    m_Localized: Yes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88075013436723200
    m_Localized: "Are you sure you want to quit?\nAll unsaved progress will be lost."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
