  - m_Id: 203009390581719040
    m_Localized: To catch a signal, turn the right knob. To do this, rotate the right joystick of the gamepad clockwise or counterclockwise. The knob for adjusting the volume is on the left.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 203009496299151360
    m_Localized: If you still can't get a signal, try changing the wave range. To do this, press the left or right bumper and continue searching for the wave you need using the right stick.
